- Room (L-shaped, sticky underfoot): a cracked fountain; contents: a sleeping creature; exits: an iron-bound door.
- Room (narrow, cold and echoing): a rusted chain hanging from above; contents: a pile of broken tools; exits: a barred gate.
- Room (vaulted, eerily still): a dusty throne; contents: an old campsite; exits: a collapsed passage half cleared, a curtained doorway, a spiral stair going down.
